    narr:narration """The narrative surrounding [decision capture](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) has transitioned from a foundational architectural thesis in March 2026 to a realized operational milestone by August. Following the [successful shipment](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786614422719_1) of the async decision widget, the discourse has pivoted toward evaluating the causal factors behind recent performance gains. While [velocity metrics](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786614422719_2) reached a quarterly high, the conversation now centers on identifying the primary driver of this momentum, with the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786614422719_3) explicitly framed as the critical unlock. The trajectory remains open, balancing the technical enablement of the new widget against broader systemic integrations as the primary [causal attribution](narr:Position_SprintVelocityCausalAttribution) for the team's output.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786614422719_1> ;
